  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/f6835b7f8b09b613b2546a1c3f423ec7997cbbe1652f901e3b017271427ccbd3.png] \n\nGiven equation: 7 × 4 − 8 × 2 + 3 × 14 × 5 − 9 = 133\n\nLet's check each option by interchanging two numbers.\n\n**Option 1) Interchanging 14 and 9:**\n\nEquation becomes: 7 × 4 − 8 × 2 + 3 × 9 × 5 − 14 = 133\n\n⇒ __**7 × 4**__ − __**8 × 2**__ + __**3 × 9**__ × 5 − 14 = 133\n\n⇒ 28 − 16 + __**27 × 5**__ − 14 = 133\n\n⇒ __**28 − 16**__ + 135 − 14 = 133\n\n⇒ 133 = 133\n\nThe equation is correct when 14 and 9 are interchanged.\n\n**Option 2) Interchanging 7 and 14:**\n\nEquation becomes: 14 × 4 − 8 × 2 + 3 × 7 × 5 − 9 = 133\n\n⇒ __**14 × 4**__ − __**8 × 2**__ + __**3 × 7**__ × 5 − 9 = 133\n\n⇒ 56 − 16 + __**21 × 5**__ − 9 = 133\n\n⇒ __**56 − 16**__ + 105 − 9 = 133\n\n⇒ 136 ≠ 133\n\n**Option 3) Interchanging 9 and 8:**\n\nEquation becomes: 7 × 4 − 9 × 2 + 3 × 14 × 5 − 8 = 133\n\n⇒ __**7 × 4**__ − __**9 × 2**__ + __**3 × 14**__ × 5 − 8 = 133\n\n⇒ 28 − 18 + __**42 × 5**__ − 8 = 133\n\n⇒ __**28 − 18**__ + 210 − 8 = 133\n\n⇒ 212 ≠ 133\n\n**Option 4) Interchanging 2 and 4:**\n\nEquation becomes: 7 × 2 − 8 × 4 + 3 × 14 × 5 − 9 = 133\n\n⇒ __**7 × 2**__ − __**8 × 4**__ + __**3 × 14**__ × 5 − 9 = 133\n\n⇒ 14 − 32 + __**42 × 5**__ − 9 = 133\n\n⇒ __**14 − 32**__ + 210 − 9 = 133\n\n⇒ 183 ≠ 133\n\nHence, the correct answer is **Option 1) 14 and 9**.",
